        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/nook-2.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>My Animal Crossing island isn't a spot in the ocean so much as it's a gap in the day. It's a place I return to at least once every 24 hours. Like Dale Cooper and his coffee, I don't plan for it, I just let it happen. In between the school run, the inbox, whatever I'm writing and whatever I need to leave the house for, there will surely be that glittering moment when the Switch - or the <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/platforms/switch-2\">Switch 2</a> - calls to me, where I wonder how Spike is doing today, and where I feel like a trip to the Roost would hit pretty good right about now.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/animal-crossing-new-horizons-update-doing-nothing-at-all\">Read more</a></p>",
